"l┌ welcome ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐W"
"┌│ Where lastcall looks                                   │┐"
"││                                                        ││"
"││ The list holds every git repository directly inside    ││"
"││ this directory. One kept a folder deeper, such as      ││"
"││ worktrees/<name>, is not listed unless you ask.        ││"
"││                                                        ││"
"││ > Keep looking one folder down                         ││"
"││   Look two folders down, and remember that             ││"
"││     (writes search_depth = 2)                          ││"
"││                                                        ││"
"││ enter  choose          q  skip the rest                ││"
"└└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘┘"
"↑↓ scroll  ← back  t hide empty  ? help  q quit             "
